Prohibition on private funds for conducting
HB0228
elections.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Knapp, Allemand, Bear, Brown, G,
Clouston, Haroldson, Johnson, Locke, Strock, Tarver
and Wylie and Senator(s) Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to elections; prohibiting government officials and election
officials from accepting private funds to conduct elections as specified;
prohibiting any person from providing or offering private funds for purposes of
conducting an election; providing exceptions; creating new misdemeanor
offenses; and providing for an effective date.
